    <requireLicenseAcceptance>false</requireLicenseAcceptance>
    <tags>cfml coldfusion lucee lsp language-server linter cli</tags>
    <summary>CFML language server and command-line checks</summary>
    <description><![CDATA[clif (pronounced "cliff", formerly cfmleditor-lsp) is a Language Server Protocol server for CFML / ColdFusion, and a command-line tool for the same checks: unresolved component and method calls, references, formatting, CFLint and a whole-project code map.

The VS Code, Zed and IntelliJ CFML extensions run it as their language server. Installing it here puts `clif` on PATH, and `cfmleditor-lsp` beside it for extensions that still look for the old name.

```
clif unresolved .
clif explain path\to\file.cfc 104
clif --help
```
]]></description>
  </metadata>
  <files>
    <file src="tools\**" target="tools" />
  </files>
</package>
